    "macOS did not start the helper. DInput mode works without it; Settings › Privileged helper › Repair helper registers it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O macOS não iniciou o helper. O modo DInput funciona sem ele; Ajustes › Helper privilegiado › Reparar helper registra de novo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 尚未启动辅助程序。DInput 模式无需它也可正常使用；可前往“设置 › 特权辅助程序 › 修复辅助程序”重新注册。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS needs to allow Space Station to control the keyboard and mouse (Privacy & Security › Accessibility).": {
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O macOS precisa permitir que o Space Station controle o teclado e o mouse (Privacidade e Segurança › Acessibilidade)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要授予 Space Station 控制键盘与鼠标的权限（系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 辅助功能）。"
